        <obo:IAO_0000115>A &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-proline derivative in which &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-proline is substituted on nitrogen with a (2&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)-2-methyl-3-sulfanylpropanoyl group. It is used as an anti-hypertensive ACE inhibitor drug.</obo:IAO_0000115>
