            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A thienopyridine that is 4,5,6,7-tetrahydrothieno[3,2-&lt;em&gt;c&lt;/em&gt;]pyridine in which the hydrogen attached to the nitrogen is replaced by an &lt;em&gt;o&lt;/em&gt;-chlorobenzyl group, the methylene hydrogen of which is replaced by a  methoxycarbonyl group (the &lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt; enantiomer). A P2Y&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;12&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; receptor antagonist, it is used to inhibit blood clots and prevent heart attacks.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>beilstein:8151914</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
